                            "source": "https://github.com/XRPLF/rippled/blob/3.4.1/src/libxrpl/protocol/ErrorCodes.cpp",
                            "note": "internalJson and internalSubmit are set in src/xrpld/rpc/handlers/transaction/Submit.cpp; internalTransaction has no rippled source at 3.4.1, 2.0.0 or 1.12.0."
